@startuml
title Sequence - UC-09 Tự động điều phối phương tiện
actor "Admin Dashboard" as AdminUI
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Dispatching Service" as Dispatch
participant "Spark Batch Jobs" as Spark
participant "Kafka" as Kafka
database "DB" as DB

== Lên lịch tự động ==
...[At 16:00 daily]...
Dispatch -> DB : read next-day trips, vehicles, drivers
DB --> Dispatch : data
Dispatch -> Spark : trigger optimization
Spark -> DB : read capacity & constraints
DB --> Spark : data
Spark -> DB : write proposed assignments
Spark -> Kafka : publish dispatch plan

Kafka -> Dispatch : new plan event
Dispatch -> DB : persist plan
Dispatch --> API : notify ready
API --> AdminUI : show plan for approval
@enduml